      "text": "We can see that \\begin{align*}\n\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A} &= \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} - \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 1 \\end{pmatrix},\n\\end{align*}so\n\\begin{align*}\n\\mathbf{A} - \\mathbf{I} &= \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} - \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}.\n\\end{align*}Then\n\\begin{align*}\n\\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} &= \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}.\n\\end{align*}Multiplying these together, we write\n\\[\\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} -1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} = (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}).\\]since $-\\mathbf{I}\\mathbf{A} = \\mathbf{A}(-\\mathbf{I}).$  Then\n\\begin{align*}\n\\mathbf{I}^{2n} - \\mathbf{I}^{2n - 2} + \\mathbf{I}^{2n - 4} - \\cdots - \\mathbf{I}^2 + \\mathbf{I} &= (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}), \\\\\n\\mathbf{I}^{2n - 1} + \\mathbf{I}^{2n - 3} + \\mathbf{I}^{2n - 5} + \\cdots + \\mathbf{I}^3 + \\mathbf{I} &= (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}) - 2\\mathbf{(I - A)}.\n\\end{align*}Therefore, if we let $n = 4,$ we obtain\n\\[(\\mathbf{A}^8 + \\mathbf{A}^6 + \\mathbf{A}^4 + \\mathbf{A}^2 + \\mathbf{I}) \\mathbf{v} = (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}) \\mathbf{v} + 2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}) \\mathbf{v} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 11 \\end{pmatrix},\\]so we must have\n\\begin{align*}\n(\\mathbf{A}^8 + \\mathbf{A}^6 + \\mathbf{A}^4 + \\mathbf{A}^2 + \\mathbf{I}) \\mathbf{v} &= (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}) \\mathbf{v} + 2 (\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A}) \\mathbf{v} = \\boxed{\\begin{pmatrix} -9 \\\\ 11 \\end{pmatrix}}.\n\\end{align*}. The answer is \\begin{pmatrix}-9\\11\\end{pmatrix}",
